    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math interesting, especially when it connects to real-life applications like economics or cooking. It’s practical, and I enjoy working through problems. I have a vocational diploma, so I've used math in daily tasks, like budgeting and measuring. It’s not something I love deeply, but I do appreciate its usefulness.",
