    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a math tutor app last year. It was helpful for quick explanations on topics I struggled with. I especially liked the step-by-step breakdowns. It didn’t replace my studying, but it helped me get confirmation on my answers and reinforced what I already knew. It felt like a good complement to my learning.",
