    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can offer personalized tutoring by adapting to a student's learning pace and style. They can explain concepts in different ways and provide instant feedback. They can also generate practice problems and offer hints. They’re great for students who need extra help or want to explore topics in depth. It’s a tool to support learning, not replace teachers."
